6:18Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"message":"feat(theme): rebalance bundled fonts to a varied 10-font cross-section\n\nReplace the bundled set (was 7 sans + 1 mono + 1 slab, no serif/condensed) with a balanced cross-section of 10 covering common use cases: Inter (neutral sans), Open Sans (humanist sans), Montserrat (geometric sans), Merriweather (serif), Playfair Display (display serif), Roboto Slab (slab), JetBrains Mono (monospace), Oswald (condensed), Nunito (rounded), Roboto (default sans). Dropped: Lato, Noto Sans, Roboto Mono, Source Sans 3. Also shortens the German font sample to Franz jagt im Taxi quer durch Bayern.","tree":{"sha":"8862f5f17c467acc8a9c77752bc5ed565238fc3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/8862f5f17c467acc8a9c77752bc5ed565238fc3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/19688900a29ef6b38b311be523bd30cfd1f590dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/