T11:41:40Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"message":"feat(theme): add a font-sources help hint at the font selection\n\nA HelpHint (?) next to the font-family selector explains all four sources (Bundled = shipped/consistent/offline, System = device-dependent, Google = loaded+embedded, Custom = any CSS font name), so Eigen/Custom and the System-vs-Bundled difference are clear in the UI.","tree":{"sha":"ed981d573b04c0332a3206ada8c5706c344043a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/ed981d573b04c0332a3206ada8c5706c344043a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/7cd63a2e20faf758e18ffe6ec92e6ce65827af08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/7cd63a2e20faf758e18ffe6ec92e6ce65827af08","node_id":"C_kwDONtERsNoAKDdjZDYzYTJlMjBmYWY3NThlMThmZmU2ZWM5MmU2Y2U2NTgyN2FmM