orgia, Times New Roman, ...) alongside the generic stacks; ''Custom'' stays as the escape hatch. Font weights moved into a 2x2 grid of compact selects with short labels (Leicht/Regular/Medium/Fett).","tree":{"sha":"8c3346da49108e53fd5cbb64d217b78549135d33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/8c3346da49108e53fd5cbb64d217b78549135d33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/1fa5c61d212264acc83111cc527323ba38166a09","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/1fa5c61d212264acc83111cc527323ba38166a09","node_id":"C_kwDONtERsNoAKDFmYTVjNjFkMjEyMjY0YWNjODMxMTFjYzUyNzMyM2JhMzgxNjZhMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/75e222abc2edb390f6d7db64f2739591e3f24f6b","sha":"75e222abc2edb390f6d7db64f2739591e3f24f6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/75e222abc2edb390f6d7db64f2739591e3f24f6b"}],"sha":"1fa5c61d212264acc83111cc527323ba38166a09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/1fa5c61d212264acc83111cc527323ba38166a09"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/75e222abc2edb390f6d7db64f2739591e3f24f6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:23:03Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T10:23:03Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"message":"feat(theme): per-corner border radius and remove the studio preview\n\nBorder radius is now settable per corner (top-left/top-right/bottom-right/bottom-left, default 4 each) with a link toggle for the uniform case. The four radii are stored as a custom ''corners'' extension and applied at runtime as a 4-value CSS border-radius on the surface components (MuiPaper, MuiCard), since MUI''s shape.borderRadius is single-valued. The single Eckradius slider in Schrift & Form is replaced by the four corner sliders. Also removes the studio''s inline preview block — the live canvas preview makes it redundant.","tree":{"sha":"86d9156c38c203e422a039eb648cd6070a034e6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/86d9156c38c203e422a039eb648cd6070a034e6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/75e222abc2edb390f6d7db64f2739591e3f24f6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/75e222abc2edb390f6d7db64f2739591e3f24f6b","node_id":"C_kwDONtERsNoAKDc1ZTIyMmFiYzJlZGIzOTBmNmQ3ZGI2NGYyNzM5NTkxZTNmMjRmNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/3ae0ec6d33796facec21ea01263b1e20a840822d","sha":"3ae0ec6d33796facec21ea01263b1e20a840822d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/3ae0ec6d33796facec21ea01263b1e20a840822d"}],"sha":"75e222abc2edb390f6d7db64f2739591e3f24f6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/75e222abc2edb390f6d7db64f2739591e3f24f6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/3ae0ec6d33796facec21ea01263b1e20a840822d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T09:41:23Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T09:41:23Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"message":"feat(theme): make text follow primary and add four dark presets\n\ntext.primary now defaults to the effective primary color (manual override still wins), via a shared withPrimaryAsText derivation applied in both the runtime hook and the studio panel — so body text stays consistent with the chosen accent across all widgets, replacing the old host-primary text override in CollectionProvider. Also adds four cohesive dark presets: Smaragd (emerald), Amethyst (violet), Rubin (red), Bernstein (gold).","tree":{"sha":"1b80f36d963f92b3ce1680b1ec2a00b98254bd69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/1b80f36d963f92b3ce1680b1ec2a00b98254bd69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/3ae0ec6d33796facec21ea01263b1e20a840822d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/3ae0ec6d33796facec21ea01263b1e20a840822d","node_id":"C_kwDONtERsNoAKDNhZTBlYzZkMzM3OTZmYWNlYzIxZWEwMTI2M2IxZTIwYTg0MDgyMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/6ed3fa264f8a90c9707d61e461f83175b9e32a5a","sha":"6ed3fa264f8a90c9707d61e461f83175b9e32a5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/6ed3fa264f8a90c9707d61e461f83175b9e32a5a"}],"sha":"3ae0ec6d33796facec21ea01263b1e20a840822d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/3ae0ec6d33796facec21ea01263b1e20a840822d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/6ed3fa264f8a90c9707d61e461f83175b9e32a5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T09:01:05Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T09:01:05Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"message":"feat(theme): show effective colors, align swatches, and curate presets\n\nColor fields now display the effective (mode-aware, MUI-resolved) color, so every slot — including status colors — is populated even without a preset, and switching the color mode visibly recomputes them. The mode defaults to Auto (follows the vis-2 host) and shows the effective host mode. Presets are curated cohesive palettes (primary + secondary + backgrounds; status stays at MUI semantic defaults). Color rows use a 1fr/auto grid so swatches align regardless of label length; a reset button replaces clear (reverts to the resolved default). Only explicit overrides are persisted.","tree":{"sha":"5ba775d7808814dcc78432712c65c5cba7ce0403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/5ba775d7808814dcc78432712c65c5cba7ce0403"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/6ed3fa264f8a90c9707d61e461f83175b9e32a5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/6ed3fa264f8a90c9707d61e461f83175b9e32a5a","node_id":"C_kwDONtERsNoAKDZlZDNmYTI2NGY4YTkwYzk3MDdkNjFlNDYxZjgzMTc1YjllMzJhNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/20f1ffc7472ef5f9b2f3821b7ea3d7c58c0b387c","sha":"20f1ffc7472ef5f9b2f3821b7ea3d7c58c0b387c","