"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/d5801eeafffe228814b1e1f76198ec6d0a163afe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T11:56:31Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T11:56:31Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"message":"refactor(json-table): remove dead code and align with conventions\n\nCleanup-only, no behavior change:\n\n- Drop the synthetic __id injection in gridRows: nothing reads it (no getRowId is wired), so TanStack already keys rows by index; the injection only polluted the row objects.\n\n- Remove the hardcoded oidValue=\"\" (and the commented-out real value) passed to CollectionBase; the prop defaults to null which yields the same empty footer fallback.\n\n- Delete the four empty no-op lifecycle overrides (propertiesUpdate/onRxDataChanged/onRxStyleChanged/onStateUpdated); the Generic/VisRxWidget base defaults are already no-ops.\n\n- Translate the remaining German section comments in jsonTableFields to English per the English-only code-comment convention.\n\n- Update the formatDateValue jsdoc @param name to match the renamed inputFormat parameter.","tree":{"sha":"105b949b38740c4ac616e14de227aba3ee142b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/105b949b38740c4ac616e14de227aba3ee142b2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/d5801