e":"steiger04"},"message":"feat(json-table): enhance filter dialog with type-specific controls\n\nAdd appropriate input controls for each data type:\n- Boolean columns: dropdown select with true/false options\n- Date columns: native date picker input\n- Number columns: number input field\n- String columns: text input field\n\nImprove UX with active filter indicator chip, full-screen mode on\nmobile devices, Enter key support, and better button layout.\n\nAdd accessibility features with proper ARIA attributes and labels.","tree":{"sha":"d40549b68dfe4099e886bcbaa1351f7630a27727","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/d40549b68dfe4099e886bcbaa1351f7630a27727"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/eb88e08c868870c2172d1fb47ca6fa1f0c24a6f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/eb8