ration before useMemo\n\nFixes ''Cannot access before initialization'' ReferenceError by ensuring\nthe variable is defined before being referenced in the useMemo dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"ee86085900849ce3b74d01803047929ad0797d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/ee86085900849ce3b74d01803047929ad0797d6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/2aff6151d111085726fa19dfbd37c288aec675ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/2aff6151d111085726fa19dfbd37c288aec675ba","node_id":"C_kwDONtERsNoAKDJhZmY2MTUxZDExMTA4NTcyNmZhMTlkZmJkMzdjMjg4YWVjNjc1YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commit/71fe0a26eda2b32140615784f41bbb0f4d2e970e","sha":"71fe0a26eda2b32140615784f41bbb0f4d2e970e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/71fe0a26eda2b32140615784f41bbb0f4d2e970e"}],"sha":"2aff6151d111085726fa19dfbd37c288aec675ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/2aff6151d111085726fa19dfbd37c288aec675ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/commits/71fe0a26eda2b32140615784f41bbb0f4d2e970e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T12:37:51Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T12:37:51Z","email":"steiger04@posteo.de","name":"steiger04"},"message":"fix(json-table): tie column filtering to column menu to prevent invisible active filters\n\nUsers could end up with permanently filtered data they cannot clear when the\ncolumn menu was disabled but table filtering remained enabled. The filter UI only\nexists in the column menu, but useReactTable still applied column filters\nindependently.\n\nIntroduce canUserAccessColumnFiltering flag that requires both tableFiltering\nAND tableColumnMenu to be enabled. Use this flag consistently for:\n- enableColumnFilters in useReactTable\n- buildColumnDefs tableFiltering prop\n- ColumnMenu tableFiltering prop\n- Column menu button visibility condition\n\nThe existing useTableSettings hook already clears columnFilters state when\ntableFiltering becomes false, so passing the effective filtering flag ensures\ninvisible filters are automatically cleared when the column menu is disabled.\n\nAdd tooltip to tableFiltering editor field to make the dependency explicit.","tree":{"sha":"468b723c997c3cd32a7a3061a4b91117a0bb7ac7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/trees/468b723c997c3cd32a7a3061a4b91117a0bb7ac7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-2-widgets-collection/git/commits/71fe0a26eda2b32140615784f41bbb0f4d2e970e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17086944?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04","id":17086944,"login":"Steiger04","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDg2OTQ0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Steiger04","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Steiger04/ioBroker.vis-