lenstanev","id":1479710,"login":"milenstanev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0Nzk3MTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milenstanev/desktop-ui/commits/db4b6220f22cdb87307633b0721fdacfa2f22759/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T14:22:30Z","email":"milen.stanev@gmail.com","name":"mstanev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T14:24:15Z","email":"milen.stanev@gmail.com","name":"mstanev"},"message":"Refactor architecture, shared forms, and README as scalable starter\n\nProject structure:\n- Reorganize src/ into app, core, shared, features\n- Move store, middleware, hooks, utils to core/\n- Move Window, ErrorBoundary, Icons, Loader to shared/\n\nFormEditor as preview:\n- Extract form fields to shared/forms (TextField, NumberField, etc.)\n- FormEditor uses shared forms; keeps only schema-driven preview logic\n- Move field unit tests to shared/forms\n\nREADME as serious starter:\n- Position as starter template for scalable React applications\n- Add Quick Start, architecture diagram, Example Feature Module\n- Add badges, Who This Is For, Project Goals\n- Improve documentation navigation and tone\n\nTesting:\n- Fix test:memory to use playwright.memory.config.ts\n- Fix test:memory:forever to call test:memory\n- Update playwright.memory webServer to serve build\n- Remove unsupported testPathIgnorePatterns from Jest config\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"a54fd1b11634dc0e5041de19663a6231cff13545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milenstanev/desktop-ui/git/trees/a54fd1b11634