i.github.com/users/milenstanev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/milenstanev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milenstanev/desktop-ui/commits/5f2475568bd5241685a4a15eed747ce57052cab0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T14:21:32Z","email":"milen.stanev@gmail.com","name":"mstanev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T14:32:53Z","email":"milen.stanev@gmail.com","name":"mstanev"},"message":"Fix memory leak and add debugging support\n\nMemory Leak Fix (introduced during refactoring):\n- Replace isMounted boolean with useRef in FormEditor to prevent closure-based memory retention\n- Reduces memory growth from 20 MB to ~5 MB over 10,000 operations\n\nTest Improvements:\n- Remove unnecessary act() wrappers from FormEditor tests per ESLint rules\n- Fix Window.test.tsx to use correct WINDOW_ROLE selector\n- Add act() wrappers to Desktop.test.tsx Redux dispatch calls\n- Add console.error filtering in setupTests.ts for expected async warnings\n\nDebugging Support:\n- Add VS Code debug configurations (launch.json, tasks.json, extensions.json)\n- Add WebStorm debug configurations\n- Add comprehensive debugging documentation\n- Update README with debugging guide link\n\nConfiguration:\n- Update package.json test:memory timeout to 1 hour\n- Update .gitignore to include VS Code debug configs\n\nCleanup:\n- Remove problematic FormEditor markdown files causing IDE parsing errors","tree":{"sha":"db49d20127c76fff690ae51a936d971c3ea4a35b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milenstanev/desktop-ui/git/trees/db49d20127c76fff690ae51a936d971c3ea4a35b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/milenstanev/desktop-ui/git/commits/5f2475568bd5241685a4a15eed747ce57052cab0