ons, save handling, and related tests; update routes and UI.\n\n* Restyle organization invitation email template with improved layout, refined typography, and updated button styles; adjust package-lock peer metadata.\n\n* Use `MANAGEMENT_URL` environment variable in Vite config for dynamic remote entry resolution.","tree":{"sha":"1b0d9d6542b15b9d4c4aecf95777532845c2f608","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/1b0d9d6542b15b9d4c4aecf95777532845c2f608"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/323dc6140a8d3198fc74957f2a9edf2e128a55a9","verification":{"payload":"tree 1b0d9d6542b15b9d4c4aecf95777532845c2f608\nparent 16fb33b2594b761df4390c751fa6074c54b52b37\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1788357947 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788357947 +0200\n\nUpdated Email templates (#59)\n\n* Switch to `dotenvx` for encrypted environment variable management in development configuration.\n\n* Add `formatVersion` field to inputs schema, extend assemblies schema with `incomplete` boolean column, and create `organizationAssembly` GraphQL test suite.\n\n* Add AssemblyEditor components, live GWP calculations, save handling, and related tests; update routes and UI.\n\n* Restyle organization invitation email template with improved layout, refined typography, and updated button styles; adjust package-lock peer metadata.\n\n* Use `MANAGEMENT_URL` environment variable in Vite config for dynamic remote entry resolution.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmC07CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8V4QAG4LL3fsZTU15kVCNqPMJ0QR\nxzSZp+2oUH7VP9kTmkIFcdevrbPRbJI9Ug3xjGhKE8a7F/i7dJtFl18upgMu0JZ4\nsiiLzkCoxidjyB3YanJ++ifiSXX2W8E81G8w/PGck6qnhyusYq/DlMRMoiD1VFt9\nR0BLm/DAbcd9V0TQpqIzLMDYEW/i4UNqlYKnI/hYWr03/1QFGePaEV+8RHFD/8RX\nIms+WUVdVx6ycMs2LL0li24efLkxu1FZf0ObQYO5aZ5xbV7RNj8oLXTArDAUEzyA\nElJcM7SkPqzC0ehNkV0fu+2BaA0ENmwO0sHtPLfLdk9+i7fFwZQ2Xmy1tFboglkj\na6+fb5dlXdv/+yGczF4ApNFgLj+89t46z