ck from search.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Fix indentation and spacing issues in `ResultsPage.tsx` and `SearchPage.tsx`.\n\n* Add ADRs for mixed search, public assembly visibility, drafts, and organization assemblies page. Update context and glossary for LCAx terminology.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b4f25889c7bf7082cd9422b36536c4ed2c159c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/5b4f25889c7bf7082cd9422b36536c4ed2c159c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/02bbe1256cbf4c14e00a482f44b5d1b9bac963b9","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b4f25889c7bf7082cd9422b36536c4ed2c159c0\nparent 8414af3fb3ebf78db9d49b9c1a4d72dd82b4f397\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1788346808 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788346808 +0200\n\nAdd Assembly search page and mixed search functionality (#57)\n\n* Add GraphQL search union and shared visibility helper.\n\nQuery.search returns a name-sorted, 50-capped mix of EPD and Assembly with the same Public-OR-own-org Visibility as epds.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Add assemblies query and batched Product expansion.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Wire mixed search UI with type chips and union filters.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Add Assembly detail page at /assemblies/:id.\n\nCopy GraphQL id, hydrate composition and results, and preserve /results filters when navigating back from search.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Fix indentation and spacing issues in `ResultsPage.tsx` and `SearchPage.tsx`.\n\n* Add ADRs for mixed search, public assembly visibility, drafts, and organization assemblies page. Update context and glossary for LCAx terminology.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmAG4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAA