ividers, and yellow fill CTAs with trailing Tabler icons.\n  * Replaced Paper/Card boxed widgets and badge chrome with clean typographic hierarchy and InfoBlock metrics.\n  * Restyled SearchPage, ResultsPage, EPDDetailPage, and StatisticsPage with full-height chapter layouts and simplified upload/filter panels.\n  * Added postcss.config.cjs for Mantine breakpoint variables and resolved internal UI library/query exports.\n- Files changed: apps/epd-search/postcss.config.cjs, apps/epd-search/src/components/*, apps/epd-search/src/pages/*, apps/epd-search/src/queries/index.ts, apps/epd-search/src/lib/hooks/useListMembers.ts, packages/ui/src/components/RolePermitter/RolePermitter.tsx\n- Blockers / notes for next iteration: None. All unit and build checks pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","tree":{"sha":"af86d020b7819000736f449521a0aaed7b881865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/af86d020b7819000736f449521a0aaed7b881865"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/8414af3fb3ebf78db9d49b9c1a4d72dd82b4f397","verification":{"payload":"tree af86d020b7819000736f449521a0aaed7b881865\nparent 4aaed650df210352fff6d6a91cadc2a138e3ea1e\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1788343397 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788343397 +0200\n\nJUNIE: Restyle epd-search to the Compare design system (#54) (#56)\n\n- Task completed + PRD: Restyled apps/epd-search pages and components to align with the Compare design system and docs/agents/design.md per Issue #54 handoff spec.\n- Key decisions made:\n  * Adopted grey.0 canvas, responsive container sizing via useMatches, black hairline dividers, and yellow fill CTAs with trailing Tabler icons.\n  * Replaced Paper/Card boxed widgets and badge chrome with clean typographic hierarchy and InfoBlock metrics.\n  * Restyled SearchPage, ResultsPage, EPDDetailPage, and StatisticsPage with full-height chapter layouts and simplified upload/filter panels.\n 