.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ocni-dtu","id":16247318,"login":"ocni-dtu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjQ3MzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/88c6efde6ccf2821b8eca31b4a830d9cbf3f32f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T08:45:11Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T08:45:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"JUNIE: Role Hierarchy and Visibility for LCAx Upload (PRD #47) (#52)\n\n* JUNIE: Implement role hierarchy and visibility for LCAx data upload (PRD #47)\n\nKey decisions:\n- Implemented role hierarchy: admin > owner > organization-admin > member > user.\n- Added ''Visibility'' toggle to UploadLCAxData and automatically linked to organizationId from session.\n- Protected sensitive organization management components with RolePermitter.\n- Updated backend schema and resolver to support visibility and organizationId.\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/OrganizationManagement/OrganizationInvite.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/OrganizationManagement/OrganizationMembers.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/OrganizationManagement/OrganizationSettings.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/UploadLCAxData/UploadLCAxData.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/epds.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/generated/graphql.ts\n- packages/ui/src/components/RolePermitter/RolePermitter.spec.tsx\n- packages/ui/src/components/RolePermitter/RolePermitter.tsx\n- services/lcax/src/schema/index.ts\n- services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addLCAxData.ts\n\nBlockers: None.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Remove unused and redundant components related to organization management and statistics in `epd-search`.\n\n* Implement Better Auth organization invitation accept page\n\nLoad invitation details from the email link token, require a session, and accept or reject via the organization client. After sign-in, return to the invitation using a safe redirect query param.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Remove outdated `diagnose`, `grill-with-docs`, `improve-codebase-architecture`, `tdd`, and `to-issues` agent skills and templates.\n\n* Add email templates for organization invitation and email verification\n\n- Implemented `OrganizationInvitation` and `VerifyEmail` templates.\n- Created `EmailLayout` component for shared styling across emails.\n- Added `renderEmail` utility to handle template rendering.\n- Included unit tests for email rendering and template preview variables.\n- Updated package configuration and tooling for email generation.\n\n* Implement email sending with SMTP support:\n\n- Added `EmailSender` class to handle SMTP-based email delivery.\n- Connected email invitations in Better Auth''s organization plugin.\n- Included `sendOrganizationInvitation` utility.\n- Updated email templates and environment variables configuration (`SMTP_*`) for email functionality.\n- Minor package updates.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","tree":{"sha":"51ffabf39fce33773f06670deb4b6f4b84b1c6dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/51ffabf39fce33773f06670deb4b6f4b84b1c6dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/88c6efde6ccf2821b8eca31b4a830d9cbf3f32f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 51ffabf39fce33773f06670deb4b6f4b84b1c6dd\nparent c6d5da7ee3369b80d38172bc9a6a535e49d791f7\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1788338711 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788338711 +0200\n\nJUNIE: Role Hierarchy and Visibility for LCAx Upload (PRD #47) (#52)\n\n* JUNIE: Implement role hierarchy and visibility for LCAx data upload (PRD #47)\n\nKey decisions:\n- Implemented role hierarchy: admin > owner > organization-admin > member > user.\n- Added ''Visibility'' toggle to UploadLCAxData and automatically linked to organizationId from session.\n- Protected sensitive organization management components with RolePermitter.\n- Updated backend schema and resolver to support visibility and organizationId.\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/OrganizationManagement/OrganizationInvite.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/OrganizationManagement/OrganizationMembers.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/OrganizationManagement/OrganizationSettings.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/UploadLCAxData/UploadLCAxData.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/epds.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/generated/graphql.ts\n- packages/ui/src/components/RolePermitter/RolePermitter.spec.tsx\n- packages/ui/src/components/RolePermitter/RolePermitter.tsx\n- services/lcax/src/schema/index.ts\n- services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addLCAxData.ts\n\nBlockers: None.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Remove unused and redundant components related to organization management and statistics in `epd-search`.\n\n* Implement Better Auth organization invitation accept page\n\nLoad invitation details from the email link token, require a session, and accept or reject via the organization client. After sign-in, return to the invitation using a safe redirect query param.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Remove outdated `diagnose`, `grill-with-docs`, `improve-codebase-architecture`, `tdd`, and `to-issues` agent skills and templates.\n\n* Add email templates for organization invitation and email verification\n\n- Implemented `OrganizationInvitation` and `VerifyEmail` templates.\n- Created `EmailLayout` component for shared styling across emails.\n- Added `renderEmail` utility to handle template rendering.\n- Included unit tests for email rendering and template preview variables.\n- Updated package configuration and tooling for email generation.\n\n* Implement email sending with SMTP support:\n\n- Added `EmailSender` class to handle SMTP-based email delivery.\n- Connected email invitations in Better Auth''s organization plugin.\n- Included `sendOrganizationInvitation` utility.\n- Updated email templates and environment variables configuration (`SMTP_*`) for email functionality.\n- Minor package updates.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql+IXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATk8QAAvqc+Msin6bsftLI+R3ZE93\nuMQ9mDflMOlUIIxbZ3K8rlgWJaJfB++s26kWDqVJn9sh369pjoGpxB3nU4KTW6Aq\nsLvyXv23wJC/hBtnw17/ovus5iBYIbfH4SCRPQZ4QynvNTcuw4pSspR1kyl16dYA\ndiEePGb1cCh+gkmRdX+/UMl4w/YpKK/R3eZ6rzb9kBgGonrMWIT07beEHpG3QNmm\nOCZe7yY9SaS40CLE3GmCZg69+kHBsYS6aCRUgbPXEMxH2UVBlgX1y3mDXBzunzAu\njxANP9PIc9hrmbxZKUHhHuTP6R+M4yJD89BaI3Y9uFQrnsS2UlAXNYZ4qzITboow\nUT3hjVC/j02IGNpd0F2ot6y06c/+4PFZfspLuajDO9y7VYP8s/vO+9QYs3mlG1wH\n0rAoi8ww4To8vlFUxMeszyDY3btp52Wnk+vDRKmJGnWTuTuFj6SSozo17DAmbZcF\nVXsq8AXCHzlU03NfAmxyCOUEaTDk7PtMwN8MyJIVwThJvbm+vpu9RHYIgQe46gh/\n+PY7JskAGDNTDBy/grHgvy18Tdjt52YiEjb2mxygHUeQPxAfMpjL6HGUZZZD5R/4\nS8SIOOfovUI3ZBiVw2FBJUoNNb7CkjoKszcvCpmlewStN0isx6ZfhgvlFCCMSPgF\nKSpeddlmh97By0ZvmoVI\n=LTlF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T08:45:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web