 Access Implementation (#50)\n\n* JUNIE: Implemented scoped data access for EPDs, Products, and Assemblies (Ref: #45)\n\n- Key decisions: Implemented Public/Private visibility filtering in GraphQL and REST; scoped data to user''s organizationId; granted admins full visibility.\n- Files changed: controllers/epds.ts, getEPDs.ts, GraphQL types (assemblies, epds, inputs, products), visibility.spec.ts.\n- Notes: No blockers identified.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* JUNIE: Fix lint warning in getEPDs.spec.ts\n\nTask: Resolved ''unicorn(no-thenable)'' warning in test mock.\nDecisions: Refactored Drizzle query mock to return a Promise augmented with chainable methods instead of a literal ''then'' property.\nFiles: services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/getEPDs.spec.ts\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* JUNIE: Format visibility.spec.ts\n\nTask: Applied formatting to visibility.spec.ts.\nFiles: services/lcax/src/__test__/visibility.spec.ts\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKQdrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIusQACZSpWd94JxDmOQA/uW+7ceX\nDaxYP4LN8i1lv3kZNkFQza/5KrOmqxnRzPy7ipIy0401YSLajj0yUPwZB06F/Veb\nM+QBvgshhkftSLGlo0LDxEQPuu7FiItqFwd1xjJyrRbnOyeWN1p+H1+rycwW3Jt/\nGPgNp9OsqmyTM5Jg17jXmQK58Pp49z0byr0VJAHrJ9jz8ShXq58lXlikjD/GHxJD\n+qGVP02YkBBrjwK2GIRQkMHeymzm/s2otrzm2Y+OXNKkjayJaLqigv9UgWxV7PbH\nFXaGkWDw6G84LR2o81+kuqEaoSWDzBI2aQn0RXYvlBReI6XUidUbbExfjYZ5G0WS\nljQ9vKLLI0P0PIj60z/KpgOoe2QAxn/x+/H7GpFAjonealInsrtrV+ZygJllclWh\npS5q/uD5G7MlZYzfraCC5U+te4zZVwnNNywTmCAH1BT+ijM6FoNG4xCmWlf+gRBk\nPXfFH94I4ZjZSzbnCXST/0cZ3zKEd/WGV911AM35KfmGhHH06zw4H9drLE8ZzBCA\nLw/gKS1ZjNF4GsCe8mkSkOxElj8d8UbPaN2Dn/NbM//l1GLrhlZJu+cZzdCVZKNK\nCz4PQRvh6mYhF/VSR3Iu75+KMplIDNWIth2DiX74y6s9hgs3Bvk3BsI63rw66egV\nJHbwmAQd7pTzE/um/wwr\n=ANkr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T06:42:52Z"}},"committer":{