n- Unified the upload process into a single resolver to simplify frontend logic and support bulk uploads of different types.\n- Used LCAx type field to route data to appropriate database tables.\n\nFiles Changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/UploadLCAxData/UploadLCAxData.tsx\n- services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addLCAxData.ts\n- services/lcax/src/__test__/addLCAxData.spec.ts\n- services/lcax/drizzle/0001_lethal_nekra.sql\n- (and other supporting files)\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* fix formatting\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ad86fe3d0b7e0bf6b01b767994f0f3e972cc9cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/0ad86fe3d0b7e0bf6b01b767994f0f3e972cc9cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/354affaf500940fe9b8c5a47cff5de591404c6b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ad86fe3d0b7e0bf6b01b767994f0f3e972cc9cc\nparent 629b1bdeede1c542183d2d55af84fb6fbefca988\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1781007385 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781007385 +0200\n\nUnified LCAx data upload implementation (#40)\n\n* JUNIE: Unified LCAx data upload implementation (Issue #38)\n\n- Implemented addLCAxData resolver to handle EPDs, Assemblies, and Products.\n- Created assemblies and products tables in the database schema.\n- Updated frontend UploadLCAxData component to support multiple JSON file uploads.\n- Added comprehensive tests for the new resolver.\n\nKey Decisions:\n- Unified the upload process into a single resolver to simplify frontend logic and support bulk uploads of different types.\n- Used LCAx type field to route data to appropriate database tables.\n\nFiles Changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/UploadLCAxData/UploadLCAxData.tsx\n- services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addLCAxData.ts\n- services/lcax/src/__test__/addLCAxData.spec.ts\n- services/lcax/drizzle/0001_lethal_nekra.sql\n- (and other supporting files)\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* fix formatting\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKAQZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhD4QAEFHGil3/fYzi/21M6QDYCK9\nBzO94t3tSF25BH5BLnOVZf08IqC42Qd49WdMzXHBSJPQK5GBFND+b7aiuMy1gWLF\ncNOdHWxrtinINY84JuzARQMSPTrW1D5uswJGorj4k2Ew6lFBoczzxZojpB8ap/WN\nLJMiY27yicH/kByoR3Lv3CDoDuK+kGLsrVqzbkT4qfSPw7lmx5x0O8qZu0OXGHCn\niLFvHDsKR330Or43K0zUSy35tXJW8CVn+Byt/4/kWAZKXMVqg8XLSKJp3WrdVmAY\nZANcsjrWaieMpvQ5lisEj2nMI7JZCanXwRedRDuitnOiDsaxGqiWo8yWpv0qPZEz\nygFdKfL4ER3gj1bzdnSPvbHDPHBp1g5TiTI3TczwP5dPBfmMuBTTb1Mvc34O6iNQ\nnnth+M1RSK82Te/2C9rFvNcee7+T7P2BHLFZNmPkUu9+Mxg3QVbh353+07mUR1a4\nL+GoWUlPDFKoAEyB1P8CDhXeYQtWXuQQowsznc2lhyyKpkUDx/IA0GckDoCooH08\nP+RS0u926cBQYwscaapyGhQ9S9O+q385rQD3togJOxeTqXafYRDwj2+OWz+uu9I7\nSbNQZN6QDFLeS/BbS/HibpGQ1zX88YySWkjFVEntsmtCddCSwvihuk6TaN4x4Q2Z\nbVkhAL46fobivg95K2nP\n=0WOR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-09T12:16:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/l