://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/c25e9b395b4737437b55cd9cbcb7cf7a76143a46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T17:29:22Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T17:29:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"JUNIE: feat: add granular filters to EPD search results page (#35) (#36)\n\nTask: Implement advanced filtering on the /results page as per issue 35 and PRD (.junie/plans/fix-issue-35-filters-2.md).\n\nKey Decisions:\n- Extended GraphQL `StringFilter` with `gt`, `gte`, `lt`, `lte` comparison operators.\n- Enhanced backend `whereHelper` to support these operators using Drizzle ORM.\n- Updated frontend UI (`FilterSidebar`) with new filter inputs (Selects, TextInputs, Date pickers).\n- Implemented full URL synchronization for all filters in `ResultsPage`.\n- Regenerated GraphQL client types to support new schema.\n\nFiles Changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/FilterSidebar/FilterSidebar.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/ResultsPage.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/epds.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/generated/graphql.ts\n- services/lcax/src/schema/types/epds.ts\n- services/lcax/src/schema/utils/utils.spec.ts\n- services/lcax/src/schema/utils/where.ts\n- .junie/agents/*.md\n\nNext Iteration: No immediate blockers identified.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b1be15adaf922e3cf7065e113551d4c34a085d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/5b1be15adaf922e3cf7065e113551d4c34a085d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/c25e9b395b4737437b55cd9cbcb7cf7a76143a46","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b1be15adaf922e3cf7065e113551d4c34a085d4\nparent d757d83e5d98d4447364c9acfa7fd5786ab73b8a\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1779816562 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779816562 +0200\n\nJUNIE: feat: add granular filters to EPD search results page (#35) (#36)\n\nTask: Implement advanced filtering on the /results page as per issue 35 and PRD (.junie/plans/fix-issue-35-filters-2.md).\n\nKey Decisions:\n- Extended GraphQL `StringFilter` with `gt`, `gte`, `lt`, `lte` comparison operators.\n- Enhanced backend `whereHelper` to support these operators using Drizzle ORM.\n- Updated frontend UI (`FilterSidebar`) with new filter inputs (Selects, TextInputs, Date pickers).\n- Implemented full URL synchronization for all filters in `ResultsPage`.\n- Regenerated GraphQL client types to support new schema.\n\nFiles Changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/FilterSidebar/FilterSidebar.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/ResultsPage.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/epds.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/generated/graphql.ts\n- services/lcax/src/schema/types/epds.ts\n- services/lcax/src/schema/utils/utils.spec.ts\n- services/lcax/src/schema/utils/where.ts\n- .junie/agents/*.md\n\nNext Iteration: No immediate blockers identified.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFdhyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALPcQAIlh2jsSi268cEBUbR1a150j\nPXzJwxwfWioBUWzQxunZyWB8JlhS5/n8f1QhzsbgxV1QHdmL0TZeKgN+niXG/geD\nInh+huKfDchSJSSxXp8uGsfHTpGCiWkzwHIRlCimaoTtWWrgtejMTGbBqdGmIn9J\nMFjHnVgOj43JKONQDlbOvaKCiRdsDgXl3lvo8zXyMct6zq0pfjiC3velEvIokoUd\n916n0LpMsjw2vI+fL64qZ0820LhhC7Iqp8uoh1wYLhl3BF77ONCKqVPGtjYN8X7T\njadk6NqRvDbhhVA3v5ErcndTl8fVRumutDGsacW2BBJfMiE0KmAm0mIxlS/9SB8h\nkijezvb+VshMGBY1jZQNTnADj6UtQUcZrXhpPOzdjMR/XljDR+lChESzSCVr+Oh6\n3u9v34ZBrT+2gESyhsrogaO19Qu5qga0ylednuVn+/a91KqnUNvcWOJX4YN8BZ4V\nTIhdBBQBzyY5Oi4rqla4g4bmVBMi4xc84yJM/rrV65iGeeN2Y2G+qN126pHqgcdA\niFw8XEwoLiI1R9mIySZ8Nm+sMvP091GCLOVJB0vXj6ZfYwVksIsuTnx7