://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ocni-dtu","id":16247318,"login":"ocni-dtu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjQ3MzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/e69bbe36b4c0096613901dcdeb8f773f9fb67a04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T11:46:09Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T11:46:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add skills and EPD statistics features with GraphQL support (#33)\n\n* feat(epd-search, lcax): add EPD statistics card and GraphQL resolver\n\n- Introduced `EPDStatisticsCard` component in `epd-search`, providing a visual overview of database upload statistics.\n- Added `getEPDStatistics` GraphQL resolver to `lcax` service for retrieving EPD statistics.\n- Implemented unit tests for `getEPDStatistics` resolver.\n- Updated GraphQL schema to include EPD statistics types.\n- Adjusted dependencies and removed unused packages in `package-lock.json`.\n\n* feat(diagnose, grill-with-docs, handoff, improve-codebase-architecture): add diagnostic, documentation, handoff, and architecture improvement skills\n\n- Introduced a `diagnose` skill for debugging difficult bugs with a structured human-in-the-loop process (HITL).\n- Added a `grill-with-docs` skill to stress-test plans against domain models and update documentation in real time.\n- Implemented a `handoff` skill for summarizing conversations into structured handoff documents for seamless continuation.\n- Developed the `improve-codebase-architecture` skill to identify deepening opportunities and propose refactors that enhance testability and maintainability.\n- Included detailed `SKILL.md` reference files and templates for each skill.","tree":{"sha":"eb53112cf3de33a8012d0eed4966c7f33fd29d1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/eb53112cf3de33a8012d0eed4966c7f33fd29d1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/e69bbe36b4c0096613901dcdeb8f773f9fb67a04","verification":{"payload":"tree eb53112cf3de33a8012d0eed4966c7f33fd29d1e\nparent e53ac51081d88cf9a743410618484dd630679feb\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1779191169 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779191169 +0200\n\nAdd skills and EPD statistics features with GraphQL support (#33)\n\n* feat(epd-search, lcax): add EPD statistics card and GraphQL resolver\n\n- Introduced `EPDStatisticsCard` component in `epd-search`, providing a visual overview of database upload statistics.\n- Added `getEPDStatistics` GraphQL resolver to `lcax` service for retrieving EPD statistics.\n- Implemented unit tests for `getEPDStatistics` resolver.\n- Updated GraphQL schema to include EPD statistics types.\n- Adjusted dependencies and removed unused packages in `package-lock.json`.\n\n* feat(diagnose, grill-with-docs, handoff, improve-codebase-architecture): add diagnostic, documentation, handoff, and architecture improvement skills\n\n- Introduced a `diagnose` skill for debugging difficult bugs with a structured human-in-the-loop process (HITL).\n- Added a `grill-with-docs` skill to stress-test plans against domain models and update documentation in real time.\n- Implemented a `handoff` skill 