2a57a6370bf236662389cc0f7"}],"sha":"dce68245a05750a50a59aee1a952eec15a18893e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/dce68245a05750a50a59aee1a952eec15a18893e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16247318?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ocni-dtu","id":16247318,"login":"ocni-dtu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjQ3MzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/1d7e97c445210382a57a6370bf236662389cc0f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-30T18:54:55Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-30T18:54:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Integrate user authentication and EPD upload functionality (#32)\n\n* feat: update GraphQLProvider to support authentication\n\n- Key decisions: include credentials in HttpLink to ensure session cookies are sent with requests.\n- Files changed: packages/ui/src/contexts/GraphQLProvider/GraphQLProvider.tsx\n- Blockers: None for this task. The next step is to implement the login route and form.\n\nFollows conventional commit format.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(epd-search): implement /login route and sign-in form\n\n- Added better-auth/react client configuration in src/lib/auth.ts\n- Created LoginPage with Mantine-based sign-in form and better-auth integration\n- Registered /login route in AppRouter and exported LoginPage\n- Updated AppLayout to include Sign In/Profile/Sign Out navigation based on session status\n- Files changed: apps/epd-search/package.json, apps/epd-search/src/lib/auth.ts, apps/epd-search/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/pages/index.ts, apps/epd-search/src/components/AppRouter/AppRouter.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/components/AppLayout/AppLayout.tsx, package-lock.json\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(epd-search): implement /profile route and UploadEPD component\n\n- Created UploadEPD component using Mantine Dropzone for LCAx JSON file selection.\n- Implemented ProfilePage to display user session info and the UploadEPD component.\n- Registered /profile route in AppRouter and ensured it redirects unauthenticated users to /login.\n- Installed @mantine/dropzone, @mantine/notifications, and @tabler/icons-react dependencies.\n- Updated App component with Mantine notifications and dropzone styles.\n- Files changed: apps/epd-search/package.json, apps/epd-search/src/components/App/App.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/components/UploadEPD/UploadEPD.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/components/index.ts, apps/epd-search/src/pages/ProfilePage.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/pages/index.ts, apps/epd-search/src/components/AppRouter/AppRouter.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(epd-search): integrate EPD upload with addEpds mutation\n\n- Created addEpds.graphql mutation and regenerated Apollo hooks.\n- Updated UploadEPD component to parse JSON files into EpdsInsertInput.\n- Connected ProfilePage to useAddEpdsMutation for sending data to backend.\n- Added success and error notifications using @mantine/notifications.\n- Verified with lint, format, tsc, and build.\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/addEpds.graphql\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/generated.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/UploadEPD/UploadEPD.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/ProfilePage.tsx\n\nNotes: Basic JSON parsing is implemented. Future iterations could add more robust schema validation.\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* [issue-32]\n\nIntegrate User Authentication and EPD Upload Features\n\nCo-authored-by: ocni-dtu <16247318+ocni-dtu@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Implement authentication (signup and login) in lcax service using better-auth and GraphQL\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Remove authentication integration tests, mock database setup, and migration files for refactor cleanup in LCAx service.\n\n* Update dev dependencies and bindings, add TypeScript native preview, and upgrade UUID to v14\n\n* Update tsconfig, scripts, and dependencies in UI package\n\n- Upgraded @mantine/core and @mantine/hooks to v9.1.1.\n- Replaced TypeScript compiler (`tsc`) with `tsgo` in build scripts.\n- Changed module resolution to \"Bundler\" and adjusted paths in tsconfig.\n- Declared support for CSS module imports via global.d.ts.\n\n* Upgrade @mantine dependencies to v9.1.1 and switch \"tsc\" to \"tsgo\" in compare package.\n\n* chore(epd-search): remove unused authentication and GraphQL query files for cleanup\n\n- Deleted better-auth client setup and related exports in `auth.ts`.\n- Removed unused GraphQL queries (`addEpds`, `epdDetail`, `epdSearch`) and Apollo-generated hooks.\n- Cleaned up auto-generated `generated.ts` file.\n\n* chore(lcax): update tsconfig for bundler compatibility and adjust global CSS module declaration\n\n- Switched `moduleResolution` to \"bundler\" and added TypeScript options like `allowImportingTsExtensions` and `isolatedModules`.\n- Updated `strict` mode to `false` and enforced `moduleDetection: \"force\"`.\n- Adjusted `global.d.ts` to refine CSS module imports.\n\n* chore: remove redundant skills and migrate to MCP integration\n\n- Deleted \"grill-me,\" \"prd-to-issues,\" and \"write-a-prd\" skills.\n- Added `better-auth-best-practices` skill for authentication configuration.\n- Introduced MCP integration via `.junie/mcp/mcp.json`.\n\n* chore: clean up unused imports and simplify authentication button logic in lcax and epd-search services\n\n* chore: update package-lock.json for esbuild v0.28.0 and vite v7.3.2 upgrades\n\n* chore(workflows): replace `npm ci` with `npm i` across GitHub Actions workflows for consistency\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\nCo-authored-by: junie-agent <247260674+junie-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ocni-dtu <16247318+ocni-dtu@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b978208d46d63e24f4d22b013c7738ecf7314578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/b978208d46d63e24f4d22b013c7738ecf7314578"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/1d7e97c445210382a57a6370bf236662389cc0f7","verification":{"payload":"tree b978208d46d63e24f4d22b013c7738ecf7314578\nparent 018aeec94c36ad1fda444b7648621df85b193171\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1777575295 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777575295 +0200\n\nIntegrate user authentication and EPD upload functionality (#32)\n\n* feat: update GraphQLProvider to support authentication\n\n- Key decisions: include credentials in HttpLink to ensure session cookies are sent with requests.\n- Files changed: packages/ui/src/contexts/GraphQLProvider/GraphQLProvider.tsx\n- Blockers: None for this task. The next step is to implement the login route and form.\n\nFollows conventional commit format.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(epd-search): implement /login route and sign-in form\n\n- Added better-auth/react client configuration in src/lib/auth.ts\n- Created LoginPage with Mantine-based sign-in form and better-auth integration\n- Registered /login route in AppRouter and exported LoginPage\n- Updated AppLayout to include Sign In/Profile/Sign Out navigation based on session status\n- Files changed: apps/epd-search/package.json, apps/epd-search/src/lib/auth.ts, apps/epd-search/src/pages/LoginPage.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/pages/index.ts, apps/epd-search/src/components/AppRouter/AppRouter.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/components/AppLayout/AppLayout.tsx, package-lock.json\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(epd-search): implement /profile route and UploadEPD component\n\n- Created UploadEPD component using Mantine Dropzone for LCAx JSON file selection.\n- Implemented ProfilePage to display user session info and the UploadEPD component.\n- Registered /profile route in AppRouter and ensured it redirects unauthenticated users to /login.\n- Installed @mantine/dropzone, @mantine/notifications, and @tabler/icons-react dependencies.\n- Updated App component with Mantine notifications and dropzone styles.\n- Files changed: apps/epd-search/package.json, apps/epd-search/src/components/App/App.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/components/UploadEPD/UploadEPD.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/components/index.ts, apps/epd-search/src/pages/ProfilePage.tsx, apps/epd-search/src/pages/index.ts, apps/epd-search/src/components/AppRouter/AppRouter.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(epd-search): integrate EPD upload with addEpds mutation\n\n- Created addEpds.graphql mutation and regenerated Apollo hooks.\n- Updated UploadEPD component to parse JSON files into EpdsInsertInput.\n- Connected ProfilePage to useAddEpdsMutation for sending data to backend.\n- Added success and error notifications using @mantine/notifications.\n- Verified with lint, format, tsc, and build.\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/addEpds.graphql\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/generated.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/UploadEPD/UploadEPD.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/ProfilePage.tsx\n\nNotes: Basic JSON parsing is implemented. Future iterations could add more robust schema validation.\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* [issue-32]\n\nIntegrate User Authentication and EPD Upload Features\n\nCo-authored-by: ocni-dtu <16247318+ocni-dtu@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Implement authentication (signup and login) in lcax service using better-auth and GraphQL\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Remove authentication integration tests, mock database setup, and migration files for refactor cleanup in LCAx service.\n\n* Update dev dependencies and bindings, add TypeScript native preview, and upgrade UUID to v14\n\n* Update tsconfig, scripts, and dependencies in UI package\n\n- Upgraded @mantine/core and @mantine/hooks to v9.1.1.\n- Replaced TypeScript compiler (`tsc`) with `tsgo` in build scripts.\n- Changed module resolution to \"Bundler\" and adjusted paths in tsconfig.\n- Declared support for CSS module imports via global.d.ts.\n\n* Upgrade @mantine dependencies to v9.1.1 and switch \"tsc\" to \"tsgo\" in compare package.\n\n* chore(epd-search): remove unused authentication and GraphQL query files for cleanup\n\n- Deleted better-auth client setup and related exports in `auth.ts`.\n- Removed unused GraphQL queries (`addEpds`, `epdDetail`, `epdSearch`) and Apollo-generated hooks.\n- Cleaned up auto-generated `generated.ts` file.\n\n* chore(lcax): update tsconfig for bundler compatibility and adjust global CSS module declaration\n\n- Switched `moduleResolution` to \"bundler\" and added TypeScript options like `allowImportingTsExtensions` and `isolatedModules`.\n- Updated `strict` mode to `false` and enforced `moduleDetection: \"force\"`.\n- Adjusted `global.d.ts` to refine CSS module imports.\n\n* chore: remove redundant skills and migrate to MCP integration\n\n- Deleted \"grill-me,\" \"prd-to-issues,\" and \"write-a-prd\" skills.\n- Added `better-auth-best-practices` skill for authentication configuration.\n- Introduced MCP integration via `.junie/mcp/mcp.json`.\n\n* chore: clean up unused imports and simplify authentication button logic in lcax and epd-search services\n\n* chore: update package-lock.json for esbuild v0.28.0 and vite v7.3.2 upgrades\n\n* chore(workflows): replace `npm ci` with `npm i` across GitHub Actions workflows for consistency\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\nCo-authored-by: junie-agent <247260674+junie-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ocni-dtu <16247318+ocni-dtu@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp86V/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgaYQAGyGmbfxg6dt1oBvhATSY+qU\nOPve+So3ZEENKQnJFIs6EcXLOSZH4l0JCWf0Kj3jmtIBCr5V3S9LBu4LZ5zwSGIY\nz4Z+vSVTdpTUKegs8VBh2R3Ftpt7obIZNPEM4+bkik/TV/WR6x5939Js+duufb9C\nSobes63snHT+8FbmDJTkiT4aSpQSKtC6xVngfSbK6Mq61QxqbISE54JM02Qas4XB\n+oLQhb9tl+yOKhf7REA3CGuw4ae0ZUUNkystWdIXyUx2YlDh+BFsv17QijgQaURv\nIMkLOo8p19IQquYD1ue1h/UJOf0eT2Bcc+ztiBWV49Kc48fvgWh8vt9EvnO4PWlH\nCWorOTSfQ/+So5qK0eg3nqTJh1odspSsysMzKfxU2X9VVAqtlGn/pxWIKDT7Lje0\n+1uWINCapTSNb+IteLLa5wsGEh8nPh1ivXw9IxLDZaA+n/ask56VgMTF/+/t15qc\nkuJcjsxS0iFH5UCDdXbSnn311S0S90reXlj5h8qR4091YHyOwtke9tADwfax5Ya/\nDyIKY9B+14CIeXebJA34wPPp+kyyAG9vvaiVRquARkeYLYJgyNN7HB81/kkkc+d1\nxqFAVQOq54LLJw8aNub8NqTKQPZktBEtBSXQjc2hvHqfOBQMddoKVH14cBgSTFHb\nXI2qhWGF1FLlIk6Qm7xU\n=QxYq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-30T18:54:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commit/1d7e97c445210382a57a6370bf236662389cc0f7","node_id":"C_kwDONwNhDdoAKDFkN2U5N2M0NDUyMTAzODJhNTdhNjM3MGJmMjM2NjYyMzg5Y2MwZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commit/018aeec94c36ad1fda444b7648621df85b193171","sha":"018aeec94c36ad1fda444b7648621df85b193171","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/018aeec94c36ad1fda444b7648621df85b193171"}],"sha":"1d7e97c445210382a57a6370bf236662389cc0f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/1d7e97c445210382a57a6370bf236662389cc0f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16247318?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ocni-dtu","id":16247318,"login":"ocni-dtu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjQ3MzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/018aeec94c36ad1fda444b7648621df85b193171/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T16:32:24Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T16:32:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Implement authentication and role-based access control for resolvers (#31)\n\n* feat(lcax): initialize better-auth and update database schema\n\n- Installed better-auth and updated drizzle dependencies.\n- Created auth configuration in services/lcax/src/config/auth.ts.\n- Added auth models (user, session, account, verification) in services/lcax/src/models/auth.ts.\n- Generated initial migration for auth tables.\n- Fixed issue where drizzle-kit could not load lcax WASM module by temporarily mocking lcax enums during migration generation.\n\nNote: No build script in services/lcax, using tsc and lint for verification.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): integrate better-auth session into Apollo Server context\n\n- Created GraphQLContext type and createContext function in services/lcax/src/schema/context.ts.\n- Updated Apollo Server initialization in services/lcax/src/index.ts to use the new context.\n- Refactored all GraphQL resolvers in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/ to use the typed GraphQLContext.\n- Ensured pino-http logger is properly associated with each request for logging in context.\n\nNote: This enables authentication checks in future slices by providing access to the session in resolvers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): implement auth and admin check for addEpds resolver\n\n- Updated user model in services/lcax/src/models/auth.ts to include role column.\n- Enabled admin plugin in better-auth configuration in services/lcax/src/config/auth.ts.\n- Added authentication and admin role checks to addEPDResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addEPD.ts.\n- Created unit tests for addEPDResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addEPD.spec.ts covering success and failure cases.\n- Verified changes with lint, format, tsc, and vitest.\n\nNote: Skipped database migration generation due to environment-specific WASM issues with the lcax dependency.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): implement auth and admin check for deleteEpds resolver\n\n- Added authentication and admin role checks to deleteEPDsResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/deleteEPDs.ts.\n- Created unit tests for deleteEPDsResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/deleteEPDs.spec.ts.\n- Relocated addEPD.spec.ts from incorrectly nested directory to services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addEPD.spec.ts.\n- Verified changes with lint, format, tsc, and unit tests for the affected resolvers.\n\nNote: Some existing integration tests in services/lcax/src/__test__/epds.spec.ts are failing due to pre-existing WASM/enum issues, but unit tests for the new auth logic pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): implement auth and admin check for updateEpds resolver\n\n- Added authentication and admin role checks to updateEPDsResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/updateEPDs.ts.\n- Created unit tests for updateEPDsResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/updateEPDs.spec.ts.\n- Verified changes with root-level ''check'' and ''build'' scripts (turbo run) and local vitest.\n- Noted that some existing integration tests fail due to pre-existing WASM issues, but unit tests for this slice pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): verify public access for non-protected endpoints\n\n- Created getEPDs.spec.ts to verify public access for the getEPDs resolver.\n- Updated calculateProduct.spec.ts, calculateAssembly.spec.ts, and calculationProject.spec.ts to verify public access for calculation resolvers.\n- Confirmed that public resolvers do not require a session or admin role while protected ones still do.\n- Verified changes with lint, format, tsc, and vitest.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Update services/lcax/src/schema/context.ts\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove .output.txt\n\n- Deleted `.output.txt` file, likely used for debugging or build output. This file is no longer needed, reducing repository clutter.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"53ba125c219af69aa0a79952101f7105170a68a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/53ba125c219af69aa0a79952101f7105170a68a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/018aeec94c36ad1fda444b7648621df85b193171","verification":{"payload":"tree 53ba125c219af69aa0a79952101f7105170a68a2\nparent 6a70ef1c7c95ee9aa6b61add37f79fbd077eec60\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1774369944 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774369944 +0100\n\nImplement authentication and role-based access control for resolvers (#31)\n\n* feat(lcax): initialize better-auth and update database schema\n\n- Installed better-auth and updated drizzle dependencies.\n- Created auth configuration in services/lcax/src/config/auth.ts.\n- Added auth models (user, session, account, verification) in services/lcax/src/models/auth.ts.\n- Generated initial migration for auth tables.\n- Fixed issue where drizzle-kit could not load lcax WASM module by temporarily mocking lcax enums during migration generation.\n\nNote: No build script in services/lcax, using tsc and lint for verification.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): integrate better-auth session into Apollo Server context\n\n- Created GraphQLContext type and createContext function in services/lcax/src/schema/context.ts.\n- Updated Apollo Server initialization in services/lcax/src/index.ts to use the new context.\n- Refactored all GraphQL resolvers in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/ to use the typed GraphQLContext.\n- Ensured pino-http logger is properly associated with each request for logging in context.\n\nNote: This enables authentication checks in future slices by providing access to the session in resolvers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): implement auth and admin check for addEpds resolver\n\n- Updated user model in services/lcax/src/models/auth.ts to include role column.\n- Enabled admin plugin in better-auth configuration in services/lcax/src/config/auth.ts.\n- Added authentication and admin role checks to addEPDResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addEPD.ts.\n- Created unit tests for addEPDResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addEPD.spec.ts covering success and failure cases.\n- Verified changes with lint, format, tsc, and vitest.\n\nNote: Skipped database migration generation due to environment-specific WASM issues with the lcax dependency.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): implement auth and admin check for deleteEpds resolver\n\n- Added authentication and admin role checks to deleteEPDsResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/deleteEPDs.ts.\n- Created unit tests for deleteEPDsResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/deleteEPDs.spec.ts.\n- Relocated addEPD.spec.ts from incorrectly nested directory to services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/addEPD.spec.ts.\n- Verified changes with lint, format, tsc, and unit tests for the affected resolvers.\n\nNote: Some existing integration tests in services/lcax/src/__test__/epds.spec.ts are failing due to pre-existing WASM/enum issues, but unit tests for the new auth logic pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): implement auth and admin check for updateEpds resolver\n\n- Added authentication and admin role checks to updateEPDsResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/updateEPDs.ts.\n- Created unit tests for updateEPDsResolver in services/lcax/src/schema/resolvers/updateEPDs.spec.ts.\n- Verified changes with root-level ''check'' and ''build'' scripts (turbo run) and local vitest.\n- Noted that some existing integration tests fail due to pre-existing WASM issues, but unit tests for this slice pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(lcax): verify public access for non-protected endpoints\n\n- Created getEPDs.spec.ts to verify public access for the getEPDs resolver.\n- Updated calculateProduct.spec.ts, calculateAssembly.spec.ts, and calculationProject.spec.ts to verify public access for calculation resolvers.\n- Confirmed that public resolvers do not require a session or admin role while protected ones still do.\n- Verified changes with lint, format, tsc, and vitest.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* Update services/lcax/src/schema/context.ts\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove .output.txt\n\n- Deleted `.output.txt` file, likely used for debugging or build output. This file is no longer needed, reducing repository clutter.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwryYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxLIQAJ1yIy/RadFYWB8DP4yATd0S\nrxMEJDnpIunvssywWIl+253yFaAfSY4ZYtzISpk1P6cOUEn55D928VB7O0R0qxyz\n1W4qzBCr4FFWkt3fXXRLZmoF7JisObJ/TL/wS/eIIFd4YarC9tjQRjgNfW3bX9FN\newZWO53wNn08tnn0tNcU5uDuVbrIQau8U3blyufBY7VMJX/ThO1wtCNEXYtJWHsv\nyNjmoCEQgfTet9ycUR0W3aE5vdSCkri02TXgkaO4B3A4ZddiWytfjaIN7OnrI1Xt\nyLvOHPvzVOceQdIST4UTbiqBW2m2CsSg4nFOmCDJq+d1qrHroeOwf8Q9mBw/WG9d\nBEjF9oqS9KarRq9lCDSb8I3Ofz5Tu29Brup5ylzxNz0nTfufzOcCZfpXgQNSJI0M\nA76p8JSWJ8I2D+qYaS+RFpgrgPFMT5WzPhZSwSzhKRtCtcA/MXeGI1GJbZr301yA\n6d4L8NQCrLNy+uN8aKa+RDeEZCyjUseo9sLU6kgYAV78lEE6S+nPpcDnRSLIWOQn\neyCoxLkc5t0zvvMgdTFI0PYiI8BorgdceHpUCJNk/RPD+u+leI5oNlng/G/SgQVE\nP7I7Ua5RhzUFqc7GSkmmZhld81IRy26+n5cwLg5kgpSC9VbgeDU4VCqr3BaNpSkN