lanning, integrating PRD creation and sub-issue management.\n- Updated `write-a-prd` to use `gh issue create` for PRD submission to GitHub.\n- Enhanced `prd-to-issues` to include the parent PRD when creating sub-issues.\n\n* Add `calculateAssembly` and `calculateProduct` resolvers with tests and input types\n\n- Implemented `calculateAssemblyResolver` and `calculateProductResolver` for GraphQL schema.\n- Added unit tests for both resolvers using Vitest.\n- Introduced `CalculationOptionsInput` to support resolver configuration.\n- Updated schema exports and query definitions to integrate new resolvers.\n\n* Refactor: adjust type handling in `calculateProduct.spec.ts` test for product data access\n\n* [issue-25]\n\nAdd GraphQL Resolvers, Tests, and Dev Plan Command\n\nCo-authored-by: ocni-dtu <16247318+ocni-dtu@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Apply suggestions from code review\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor: add explicit `Assembly` type casting in `calculateProduct.spec.ts` for improved type safety\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: junie-agent <247260674+junie-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ocni-dtu <16247318+ocni-dtu@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d2168fcb621c3a48bd23659c05df4f4de8f8010","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/1d2168fcb621c3a48bd23659c05df4f4de8f8010"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/48a58aec473de0b15f82bcae4596db88180a2131","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d2168fcb621c3a48bd23659c05df4f4de8f8010\nparent 8c30315d9c3fd8945e544a7a2022b66aff4bc14e\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1774366999 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774366999 +0100\n\nAdd resolvers, tests, and dev plan improvements (#25)\n\n* Add `dev-plan` command and enhance PRD-related skills\n\n- Introduced `dev-plan` command for feature planning, integrating PRD creation and sub-issue management.\n- Updated `write-a-prd` to use `gh issue create` for PRD submission to GitHub.\n- Enhanced `prd-to-issues` to include the parent PRD when creating sub-issues.\n\n* Add `calculateAssembly` and `calculateProduct` resolvers with tests and input types\n\n- Implemented `calculateAssemblyResolver` and `calculateProductResolver` for GraphQL schema.\n- Added unit tests for both resolvers using Vitest.\n- Introduced `CalculationOptionsInput` to support resolver configuration.\n- Updated schema exports and query definitions to integrate new resolvers.\n\n* Refactor: adjust type handling in `calculateProduct.spec.ts` test for product data access\n\n* [issue-25]\n\nAdd GraphQL Resolvers, Tests, and Dev Plan Command\n\nCo-authored-by: ocni-dtu <16247318+ocni-dtu@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Apply suggestions from code review\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Refactor: add explicit `Assembly` type casting in `calculateProduct.spec.ts` for improved type safety\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: junie-agent <247260674+junie-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: ocni-dtu <16247318+ocni-dtu@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwrEXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbNkQAEY8fj07bIzbZm08jnEXUb/N\nWo7zHarJ23acily+PgRGmjig0Rfrd/NW3XgOybMVxh1O380Y4QoE/wyDt8WzvqEN\n0STv38Bm6nfmhDMnDJx7bOYhI8/6s5QF31WS0nSca4HQIgM7mYjPn8d4aziq9q5w\njJ5FHXKchCRL0FGuFdcb34+NHAcohFhfBeFlXt4VUmFq+3Km+hqDXm9W2EgkMtXO\n9rAOw8IEIrk8w1D5ARANbE1MZKNCq6xdZ0Pc05+Cjj65r7TRiqiWvDoCpm3HAzQA\nBMvXT6R38LVsUAjhzlzCF9wtL3bBAW6UreISxg2g4WrSIYyyQbNXRYJAhwhx0u1Q\ngUWCriSkK7VhEQfcSo301ofGOgF0emHQh+tvaWMeFN7uHZTHl913KXeQxJUtd526\nLPrs95NQYH/9pSeK5/iJc76Mz5nF5tRFf02HVepXyzr+Nclbuoz+5j+fNPTWsWCT\n0a994jd99GOlL0Raau28qzwnZQQ