:{"date":"2026-03-24T14:22:51Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T14:22:51Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"message":"Update GitHub workflows to use the latest versions of actions\n\n- Bumped versions for `actions/checkout`, `actions/setup-node`, `actions/upload-artifact`, `actions/download-artifact`, `actions/cache`, and `docker/login-action`.\n- Added permissions for `contents` and `packages` in the `service.yaml` workflow.","tree":{"sha":"82e6ecf7744ad86c8dfbf415c306021aa6add699","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/82e6ecf7744ad86c8dfbf415c306021aa6add699"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/877d28ac8662625fdb35b7fcc8af98dcab262fcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16247318?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ocni-dtu","id":16247318,"login":"ocni-dtu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjQ3MzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commit/877d28ac8662625fdb35b7fcc8af98dcab262fcb","node_id":"C_kwDONwNhDdoAKDg3N2QyOGFjODY2MjYyNWZkYjM1YjdmY2M4YWY5OGRjYWIyNjJmY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commit/76817c35a59a519c526b8890c7a3a2edf9b12679","sha":"76817c35a59a519c526b8890c7a3a2edf9b12679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/76817c35a59a519c526b8890c7a3a2edf9b12679"}],"sha":"877d28ac8662625fdb35b7fcc8af98dcab262fcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/877d28ac8662625fdb35b7fcc8af98dcab262fcb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16247318?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ocni-dtu","id":16247318,"login":"ocni-dtu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjQ3MzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/76817c35a59a519c526b8890c7a3a2edf9b12679/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-24T14:11:31Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-24T14:11:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add foundational features for EPD search and refine functionality (#17)\n\n* feat(epd-search): implement foundation and search shell\n\n- Set up AppRouter with SearchPage and NotFoundPage routes.\n- Implement AppLayout with branding and responsive header.\n- Create SearchPage with URL query parameter support for searching.\n- Add Logo component and assets.\n- Fix CSS build error by replacing Sass variables with static values.\n- Ensure all components are correctly exported and integrated.\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/AppLayout/AppLayout.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/AppRouter/AppRouter.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/Logo/Logo.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/SearchPage.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/NotFoundPage.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/Theme/theme.module.css\n- apps/epd-search/src/assets/lcax.svg\n\nNotes:\n- Search functionality currently only updates the URL; live results are in the next sub-issue.\n- Mantine breakpoints in CSS were hardcoded to bypass lightningcss minification issues with Sass-style variables.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* refactor(epd-search): simplify meta and SVG handling, relocate assets\n\n- Removed React Helmet for meta description handling, now managed in `index.html`.\n- Updated title and meta description for improved clarity and branding.\n- Resized and adjusted SVG asset, moved `lcax.svg` to the `public` directory for better static asset handling.\n\n* feat(epd-search): implement live search results with GraphQL\n\n- Configured GraphQL codegen and Apollo provider for epd-search.\n- Implemented ResultsPage to fetch and display EPDs based on query parameters.\n- Updated SearchPage to navigate to ResultsPage and added a search button.\n- Generated GraphQL hooks and types from lcax service schema.\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/package.json\n- apps/epd-search/codegen.yaml\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/App/App.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/AppRouter/AppRouter.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/ResultsPage.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/SearchPage.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/index.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/epdSearch.graphql\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/generated.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/introspection.json\n- services/lcax/schema.graphql\n\nNotes: Codegen requires local schema generation from services/lcax. Prettier was missing during codegen but files were formatted with oxfmt afterwards.\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* chore: update `package-lock.json` to include new GraphQL-related dependencies\n\n- Added `@graphql-codegen` libraries and supporting tools for code generation.\n- Included `@apollo/client`, `graphql`, and associated development dependencies.\n\n* chore: remove `mcp.json` and add Apollo Client caching, errors, and fragments references\n\n- Removed `.ai/mcp/mcp.json`, which is no longer needed.\n- Added detailed documentation on caching, error handling, and fragments for Apollo Client.\n- Organized new references under the `skills` directory for improved resource management.\n\n* feat(epd-search): implement EPD summary cards in search results\n\n- Created EPDCard component to display Manufacturer, Category, Location, and Data Quality.\n- Updated SearchEpds GraphQL query to include metaData field.\n- Refactored ResultsPage to use SimpleGrid layout with EPDCard components.\n- Ran lint, format, and build to ensure code quality.\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/epdSearch.graphql\n- apps/epd-search/src/queries/generated.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/EPDCard/EPDCard.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/EPDCard/index.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/index.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/ResultsPage.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat: implement filtering by name and unit in EPD search\n\n- Created FilterSidebar component with Name and Declared Unit filters\n- Updated ResultsPage to integrate FilterSidebar using a Grid layout\n- Added URL parameter support for ''unit'' filter\n- Updated GraphQL query variables to include declaredUnit filter\n- Ensured search results are displayed when either name or unit is provided\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/FilterSidebar/FilterSidebar.tsx\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/FilterSidebar/index.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/components/index.ts\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/ResultsPage.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(epd-search): add EPD detail view\n\n- Created EPDDetailPage to show environmental impacts and conversions\n- Added /epd/:id route to AppRouter\n- Updated EPDCard to link to the detail page\n- Added GetEpd GraphQL query and updated generated hooks\n\nNext: Add charts to the detail view for better visualization of impacts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* feat(epd-search): add ''Try searching for'' suggestion cards to SearchPage\n\n- Defined sample search terms: ''Wood alu window'', ''Steel beam'', ''Concrete''\n- Added suggestion cards using Mantine''s Card and UnstyledButton components\n- Updated handleNavigate to accept an optional search term\n- Ensured clicking a suggestion card triggers navigation to ResultsPage with the correct query parameter\n\nFiles changed:\n- apps/epd-search/src/pages/SearchPage.tsx\n\nCo-authored-by: Junie <junie@jetbrains.com>\n\n* chore: update language usage count and refine HITL command instructions\n\n* feat: add GitHub workflow for Junie bot integration\n\n- Created `.github/workflows/junie.yaml` to handle various event triggers.\n- Configured workflow to respond to `@junie-agent` mentions in comments, reviews, and issues.\n- Integrated Junie GitHub Action with API key support via repository secrets.\n\n* chore: format `generateSchema.ts` for improved readability and maintainability\n\n* feat(epd-search): enhance search filters, suggestions, and GraphQL capabilities\n\n- Introduced `contains` filter to GraphQL schema and updated introspection and codegen.\n- Added icons to suggestion cards for clarity on the SearchPage.\n- Implemented input debounce on ResultsPage for improved query performance.\n- Replaced Apollo Client imports in generated hooks 