ists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ocni-dtu","id":16247318,"login":"ocni-dtu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjQ3MzE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ocni-dtu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/commits/924c1e1f3aa8b425c393ad75176a95d8d7dc1a63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-23T14:26:37Z","email":"christian@kongsgaard.eu","name":"Christian Kongsgaard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-23T14:26:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add EPD schema, assistant framework, and `epd-search` app (#16)\n\n* Remove Prettier, ESLint, and dependencies configuration from the repository.\n\n* Initialize `epd-search` app with Mantine, routing, and theming setup.\n\n* Add initial `skills` and `commands` framework for Junie assistant\n\n- Introduced the `prd-to-issues`, `write-a-prd`, and `grill-me` skills for automating PRD processing and user interaction.\n- Added the `hitl` command for managing human-in-the-loop workflows.\n- Configured MCP server in `.ai/mcp/mcp.json` to support Mantine integration.\n\n* Add EPD schema, resolvers, and supporting utilities\n\n- Introduced database schema for Environmental Product Declarations (EPDs), including enums for country, standard, subtype, and unit.\n- Added GraphQL types, inputs, and resolvers for querying, mutating, and deleting EPD data.\n- Configured Drizzle ORM and migration handling for EPD data structures.\n- Implemented and tested utilities for dynamic filtering, ordering, and GraphQL-related operations.\n\n* Add contribution and pull request guidelines\n\n- Added `.github/CONTRIBUTION.md` with details on branch naming, commit message formatting, development workflows, and testing requirements.\n- Introduced `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` to standardize PR submissions.\n\n* Switch to `@vitejs/plugin-react`, remove unused aliases, and standardize package and workflow configurations\n\n* Update Node.js to v24 and enhance `lcax` service configuration\n\n- Bump Node.js version to 24.x in relevant workflows and Dockerfile.\n- Refactor `lcax` service-specific Dockerfile with corrected paths and commands.\n- Introduce `start` script for `lcax` and add `uuid` and `lcax` dependencies.\n- Add new GitHub Actions workflow (`service.yaml`) for `lcax` build and deployment automation.\n\n* Switch to `@vitejs/plugin-react`, update TypeScript configs, and standardize EPD Search app setup","tree":{"sha":"63b894ee54091a77bc627177239d18cce57e8028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/trees/63b894ee54091a77bc627177239d18cce57e8028"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lcax-dev/lcax-apps/git/commits/924c1e1f3aa8b425c393ad75176a95d8d7dc1a63","verification":{"payload":"tree 63b894ee54091a77bc627177239d18cce57e8028\nparent 01a9308f1c8bf203597319e83093ed9ab78cc838\nauthor Christian Kongsgaard <christian@kongsgaard.eu> 1774275997 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774275997 +0100\n\nAdd EPD schema, assistant framework, and `epd-search` app (#16)\n\n* Remove Prettier, ESLint, and dependencies configuration from the repository.\n\n* Initialize `epd-search` app with Mantine, routing, and theming setup.\n\n* Add initial `skills` and `commands` framework for Junie assistant\n\n- Introduced the `prd-to-issues`, `write-a-prd`, and `grill-me` skills for automating PRD processing and user interaction.\n- Added the `hitl` command for managing human-in-the-loop workflows.\n- Configured MCP server in `.ai/mcp/mcp.json` to support Mantine integration.\n\n* Add EPD schema, resolvers, and supporting utilities\n\n- Introduced database schema for Environmental Product Declarations (EPDs), including enums for country, standard, subtype, and unit.\n- Added GraphQL types, inputs, and resolvers for querying, mutating, and deleting EPD data.\n- Configured Drizzle ORM and migration handling for EPD data structures.\n- Implemented and tested utilities for dynamic filtering, ordering, and GraphQL-related operations.\n\n* Add contribution and pull request guidelines\n\n- Added `.github/CONTRIBUTION.md` with details on branch naming, commit message formatting, development workflows, and testing requirements.\n- Introduced `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` to standardize PR submissions.\n\n* Switch to `@vitejs/plugin-react`, remove unused aliases, and standardize package and workflow configurations\n\n* Update Node.js to v24 and enhance `lcax` service configuration\n\n- Bump Node.js version to 24.x in relevant workflows and Dockerfile.\n- Refactor `lcax` service-specific Dockerfile with corrected paths and commands.\n- Introduce `start` script for `lcax` and add `uuid` and `lcax` dependencies.\n- Add new GitHub Actions workflow (`service.yaml`) for `lcax` build and deployment automation.\n\n* Switch to `@vitejs/plugin-react`, update TypeScript configs, and standardize EPD Search app setup","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwU2dCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAZjUQAAnCMWNyPZYsbj9IPHvVLSmX\nyKFRWBSar+WjY9Al/9edr9O3vKk5hKlJKbmJPDFHIdVDeHZ8ku70Ai4zuAMN+Rtp\nWx56umPuU/gnkJdgTc5zFcWvXcBlcBAuaQL3JNgVtE0yim9IPIaydb0hgjYEBk0K\nCEawkDsQ/+Se93t61IWsYWN73JuXYP8Qc17fsbQbhdhHU/ZUTdskk39QatYflNoE\npWG0qw0pnPxRj2YNR0e/0UqUjySGPMUh7zsSI/lkXWyun284irroQhd25WPxMkCz\njy+/sIlt6ivNsj4XoRb2HwXv/xQtX1oGBsnt94Q2PvyL2DhXbd38Zzp7sFoBG+ar\nV+n4n49yQKVio9A6P6ws0XB6RkT5GD0Ns3LF/ZayBYNin92QwO/N9uuqlJ8ubbDU\nWqietzM3NgGkXWCfcgrjYukgY9opIamI3haCFWhFSWG6cB7A/967Av6BVzew5qAy\nxMiqGmQc92k4PgY8m5UP3yyYd3R9Ycq/OdrvsHzz0WJmG1eGg7H466rSEZQeppMl\nMuWAn71HFSZw3gfi8EoqIcHb3p