n972"},"message":"fix: supprimer ins.adsbygoogle et ngAfterViewInit du composant shop\n\n- Retire les balises ins.adsbygoogle des deux aside (ads-left et ads-right)\n  pour éviter que les bloqueurs de pub masquent le logo et les catégories\n- Supprime ngAfterViewInit et les injections DOCUMENT/PLATFORM_ID devenues\n  inutiles — la résistance aux bloqueurs est désormais gérée par le CSS\n  (grid-column:2 sur section, position:absolute sur ads-right ≤1200px)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a7aa5a9006ddf9b47b3fa84b15bc767ce17d1b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/trees/5a7aa5a9006ddf9b47b3fa84b15bc767ce17d1b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/commits/97955e224495c99d9acc80feccdb5d585f013b75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22406456?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972","id":22406456,"login":"p4cm4n972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commit/97955e224495c99d9acc80feccdb5d585f013b75","node_id":"C_kwDONweMwtoAKDk