e CSS 200px/1fr/180px auto-place\nsection en colonne 1 (200px). À 200px, auto-fill minmax(280px,1fr)\nne peut afficher qu''une seule colonne de produits.\n\nFix : grid-column:2 force section à toujours occuper la colonne 1fr\nquelle que soit la présence/absence de ads-left dans le DOM.\nmin-width:0 évite les débordements. Réinitialisé à grid-column:1 à ≤768px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"382bd5a611a28e235155c3362e8404e473314030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/trees/382bd5a611a28e235155c3362e8404e473314030"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/commits/2677c5108ccb904057d481e7d49a24ac542adbb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22406456?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972","id":22406456,"login":"p4cm4n972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commit/2677c5108ccb904057d481e7d49a24ac542adbb7","node_id":"C_kwDONweMwtoAKDI2NzdjNTEwOGNjYjkwNDA1N2Q0ODFlN2Q0OWEyNGFjNTQyYWRiYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commit/8a5bd0d07b6900d18ce1461275853d5f21666451","sha":"8a5bd0d07b6900d18ce1461275853d5f21666451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commits/8a5bd0d07b6900d18ce1461275853d5f21666451"}],"sha":"2677c5108ccb904057d481e7d49a24ac542adbb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commits/2677c5108ccb904057d481e7d49a24ac542adbb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22406456?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972","id":22406456,"login":"p4cm4n972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commits/8a5bd0d07b6900d18ce1461275853d5f21666451/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T20:46:38Z","email":"manuel.adele@gmail.com","name":"P4cm4n972"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T20:46:38Z","email":"manuel.adele@gmail.com","name":"P4cm4n972"},"message":"fix: catégories shop visibles sur petit écran via position:absolute sur ads-right\n\nProblème : les onglets .tabs étaient dans aside.ads-right qui avait\ndisplay:none à ≤1200px, rendant les catégories totalement invisibles.\nposition:fixed sur .tabs n''avait aucun effet car l''élément parent\nétait display:none.\n\nFix : remplace display:none par position:absolute (hors flux grid)\navec width/height:0 et overflow:visible. Les enfants restent rendus,\n.tabs peut donc se positionner en fixed au bas du viewport.\npointer-events:none sur ads-right, pointer-events:auto sur .tabs\npour réactiver les clics sur les catégories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26a86f99c134bbc19d79bf027feebd70614e61a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/trees/26a86f99c134bbc19d79bf027feebd70614e61a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/commits/8a5bd0d07b6900d18ce1461275853d5f21666451","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22406456?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972","id":22406456,"login":"p4cm4n972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commit/8a5bd0d07b6900d18ce1461275853d5f21666451","node_id":"C_kwDONweMwtoAKDhhNWJkMGQwN2I2OTAwZDE4Y2UxNDYxMjc1ODUzZDVmMjE2NjY0NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commit/6c75c357bf08ad8c63d088287e124273e6808ff2","sha":"6c75c357bf08ad8c63d088287e124273e6808ff2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commits/6c75c357bf08ad8c63d088287e124273e6808ff2"}],"sha":"8a5bd0d07b6900d18ce1461275853d5f21666451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commits/8a5bd0d07b6900d18ce1461275853d5f21666451"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22406456?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972","id":22406456,"login":"p4cm4n972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commits/6c75c357bf08ad8c63d088287e124273e6808ff2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T20:26:53Z","email":"manuel.adele@gmail.com","name":"P4cm4n972"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T20:26:53Z","email":"manuel.adele@gmail.com","name":"P4cm4n972"},"message":"fix: shop layout - colonne unique et chevauchement catégories\n\nGrand écran (colonne unique):\n- loader-overlay était un item direct du CSS grid 3-colonnes,\n  occupant la colonne 1fr et reléguant <section> en colonne 180px.\n- Fix: loader-overlay extrait hors du .shop-layout (template multi-racine\n  Angular 17+), position:fixed couvre le viewport sans perturber le grid.\n\nPetit écran (catégories chevauchent à gauche):\n- ngAfterViewInit forçait display:block!important via inline style sur\n  TOUS les <aside>, écrasant display:none!important du breakpoint ≤1200px.\n- ads-right restait visible → descend en row 2 col 1 (gauche) du grid.\n- Fix: MutationObserver ciblé uniquement sur aside.ads-left (slots AdSense),\n  ads-right laissé au contrôle exclusif du CSS responsive.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7c0a8ff75ce09844e92df643a1a560de2a62476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/trees/e7c0a8ff75ce09844e92df643a1a560de2a62476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/commits/6c75c357bf08ad8c63d088287e124273e6808ff2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22406456?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972","id":22406456,"login":"p4cm4n972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commit/6c75c357bf08ad8c63d088287e124273e6808ff2","node_id":"C_kwDONweMwtoAKDZjNzVjMzU3Ym