: ajoute padding-bottom sur <section> à ≤1200px pour compenser\n  la barre de catégories fixe (tabs position:fixed bottom:0)\n- stat/chart: réorganisation 2 colonnes (controls 280px | chart 1fr)\n  pour éviter le scroll sur le graphique\n- version/news/stat: max-width 1400px, suppression cadres glassmorphism\n  redondants sur section et mat-tab-group\n- layout: marges horizontales adaptées par breakpoint (max-width 1400px)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"045e94d9eb56ed4b53a900d34f2eb8bb7723cec4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/trees/045e94d9eb56ed4b53a900d34f2eb8bb7723cec4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/commits/77e4c821502a3b7e5c80609f4e95429f8640f8cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22406456?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972","id":22406456,"login":"p4cm4n972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commit/77e4c821502a3b7e5c80609f4e95429f8640f8cb","node_id":"C_kwDONweMwtoAKDc3ZTRjODIxNTAyYTNiN2U1YzgwNjA5ZjRlO