7:58Z","email":"manuel.adele@gmail.com","name":"P4cm4n972"},"message":"feat(recommendations): centralize recommendation system with optimistic UI\n\n- Create RecommendationService with Angular Signals for centralized state\n- Implement optimistic UI pattern with automatic rollback on API failure\n- Add debouncing to prevent double-click race conditions\n- Unify Article interface (remove duplicate likedBy field)\n- Refactor NewsDetailComponent to use computed signals from service\n- Refactor NewsComponent with proper typing and service delegation\n- Add MatSnackBar feedback for user actions (success/error)\n- Add processing state with visual feedback (disabled button, pulse animation)\n\nAlso:\n- Update CLAUDE.md with project-specific instructions\n- Move technical docs to parent ITMADE-STUDIO/docs/ (centralized)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6ae246f3484688a7c385bda6399c290a00b784f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/trees/f6ae246f3484688a7c385bda6399c290a00b784f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/commits/4c762cf50e278b78b764b9124a30a6af906365e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22406456?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/p4cm4n972","id":22406456,"login":"p4cm4n972","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDA2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_ur