A2NDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/p4cm4n972","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/commits/e73dbdd90bafa5cb6e9cfc2df49b59efbc700dea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-17T15:02:46Z","email":"manuel.adele@gmail.com","name":"P4cm4n972"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-17T15:02:46Z","email":"manuel.adele@gmail.com","name":"P4cm4n972"},"message":"feat(news-ticker): add scrolling IT news banner under header\n\nAdded a news ticker component that displays IT news from Dev.to and Hacker News:\n- NewsTickerService fetches and combines news from multiple sources\n- Scrolling ticker with smooth CSS animation\n- Pause on hover, close button with localStorage persistence\n- Show/hide toggle button when ticker is hidden\n- Space theme styling with shop theme variant\n- Source indicators with icons and colors (Dev.to blue, HN orange)\n\nFeatures:\n- Title + short description for each news item\n- Click to open news in new tab\n- 10-minute cache for performance\n- Graceful error handling if APIs fail\n- Responsive design for mobile\n\nIncludes 25 unit tests for service and component.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49591416c5eaa9e0c2314644e06949f2cdfa534f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/trees/49591416c5eaa9e0c2314644e06949f2cdfa534f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/p4cm4n972/verstack-ihm/git/commits/e73dbdd90bafa5cb6e9cfc2df49b59efbc700dea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verif