ns.\n- Improved loading states and user feedback with toast notifications.\n\nrefactor: Streamline Task Management Dashboard\n\n- Replaced direct API calls with TanStack Query hooks for fetching tasks and task groups.\n- Simplified state management for task statistics and recent tasks.\n- Enhanced loading state handling for better user experience.\n\nfix: Update Task View to Use TanStack Query for Task Management\n\n- Refactored TaskView component to utilize TanStack Query for fetching tasks.\n- Improved task filtering logic to handle optional task properties.\n- Updated task creation handling to use mutation hooks.\n\nchore: Clean Up Create Task Dialog and Task Chat View\n\n- Removed unnecessary API calls in CreateTaskDialog, now using hooks for user and group data.\n- Updated TaskChatView to handle optional task properties for better flexibility.","tree":{"sha":"3f0df019a70d2379643defbc2db0cb947c5af858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sapmate-official/Alkaa-frontend/git/trees/3f0df019a70d2379643defbc2db0cb947c5af858"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sapmate-official/Alkaa-frontend/git/commits/68fad04bd909ddbd09626705e99306110a3aed81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138299927?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/param2610-cloud/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/param2610-cloud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/param2610-cloud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/param2610-cloud/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/param2610-cloud","id":138299927,"login":"param2610-cloud","node_id":"U_kgDOCD5KFw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/param2610-cloud/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/param2610-cloud/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/param2610